{"unit_id":"xiaxingtianxia2-glitch__dsh-chime#card-zh","repo":"xiaxingtianxia2-glitch/dsh-chime","commit":"3d13e52902b0e2e70cbfa4d170d682801d0ed612","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-chime（DSH 插件，网页客户端）：为 DSH 网页端提供任务状态提示音。它在主机侧监听 agent 状态和工具执行事件，将完成、错误或提问音效放入队列，再由浏览器客户端轮询队列并播放内嵌音频。主要功能包括任务完成提示、错误提示、提问或计划审阅提示，以及调试状态查看和指定音效试听。适合希望通过声音及时留意后台 agent 进度的网页端用户。安装后无需额外配置；浏览器需要允许音频播放。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.mjs:61-129","lib/client.js:22-47"]}
{"unit_id":"xiaxingtianxia2-glitch__dsh-chime#card-en","repo":"xiaxingtianxia2-glitch/dsh-chime","commit":"3d13e52902b0e2e70cbfa4d170d682801d0ed612","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-chime adds embedded task chimes to the DSH web client. It queues sounds for completed or failed turns and question or plan events; the browser polls and plays them. A debug route shows status and previews sounds. No extra configuration is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.mjs:61-129","lib/client.js:22-47"]}
