{"unit_id":"xiaxingtianxia2-glitch__dsh-chime#feature-1","repo":"xiaxingtianxia2-glitch/dsh-chime","commit":"3d13e52902b0e2e70cbfa4d170d682801d0ed612","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-chime 的功能「轮次结束提示」：agent 从运行状态转为空闲时，插件根据该轮是否发生错误播放完成音或错误音。事件通过主机端状态监听自动触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.mjs:61-76"]}
